ial, sans-serif;\">(</span><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">담당자&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 12pt; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">: 054-478-7898/</span><a href=\"mailto:startup@kumoh.ac.kr\" style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;, 돋움, AppleSDGothicNeo, Dotum, &quot;Droid Sans&quot;, arial, sans-serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">je0301@</span><u><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">kumoh.ac.kr)</span></u></a></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 9pt; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span><o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\">8.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\">추가 안내사항 및 공지</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\">&nbsp;-&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\">발표심사의 경우</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\">,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\">서류신청 순서대로 진행되며 신청에 따른 접수 번호는 메일로 안내 예정입니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\">&nbsp;(*</span><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\">서류심사 후 발표순서가 변경된 경우 메일로 재안내하오니 각 팀의 팀장은 메일 확인 필수</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\">)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\">&nbsp;-&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\">모든 일정 및 안내사항은 메일로 통보되오니 팀 구성원 전체의 메일주소</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\">,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\">연락처 등 틀린 부분이 없도록 확인 후 신청접수 해주시기 바랍니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\">&nbsp;-&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.2pt; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\">발표심사는 외부 심사위원으로 구성되며</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.2pt; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\">,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.2pt; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\">정해진 시간 내 다수의 팀을 심사해야함으로 신청 순서에</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 255); font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\">따른 접수 번호로 발표 순서가 정해지는 점 양해부탁드립니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\">&nbsp;(*</span><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\">팀 간 중복 시간 발생</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\">,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\">신청 팀의 요구사항을 다 반영해드릴 수 없는 점</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\">)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\">&nbsp;-&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\">수업 등으로 인한 팀 전원 참석이 불가능한 경우 사전 통보 필수이며</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\">,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\">팀장 대신 팀원 발표 가능</span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
